### GET home
GET http://localhost:8080/

### POST / add new patient
POST http://localhost:8080/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Ionescu",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "cnp": "2900101123456",
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01"
}

### GET all patients
GET http://localhost:8080/patients

### GET patient by id
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/0

### PATCH / change only firstName
PATCH http://localhost:8080/patients/0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria"
}

### GET to check PATCH (only firstName changed)
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/0

### PATCH / change two fields
PATCH http://localhost:8080/patients/0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0700000000",
  "email": "maria@mail.com"
}

### PATCH on patient that doesn't exist (expect error)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/patients/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test"
}

### PUT / replace everything (only firstName sent)
PUT http://localhost:8080/patients/0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Elena"
}

### GET to check PUT (everything else is null)
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/0

### PUT / full replace
PUT http://localhost:8080/patients/0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Ionescu",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "cnp": "2900101123456",
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01"
}

### PUT on patient that doesn't exist (expect error)
PUT http://localhost:8080/patients/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test"
}

### DELETE patient
DELETE http://localhost:8080/patients/0

### DELETE patient that doesn't exist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/patients/99

